------------------------------------------------------------------------------
§5.3 rule 4  BOUND DIRECTION for cross-band genes
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   CCL3: no cross-band donors

   CCL4: ceiling donors (6 normal / 1 tumor) sit mostly on normal; higher-valued side is normal -> difference is a LOWER BOUND

   CCL5: ceiling donors (5 normal / 1 tumor) sit mostly on normal; higher-valued side is normal -> difference is a LOWER BOUND

   XCL1: floor donors (3 normal / 2 tumor) sit mostly on normal; lower-valued side is normal

   NOTE: 'concentrated' is not given a threshold in §5.3 rule 4.
   The counts are reported as-is; no difference is claimed here.

